    "detailed_description": "Embark on a chilling journey into &quot;The Hell in I.&quot; Set in the eerie confines of a long-abandoned asylum, this first-person horror experience will test your nerves as you unravel the mysteries shrouding the infamous St. Agnes Mental Institution.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou find yourself drawn to the derelict asylum by rumors of unspeakable horrors and whispered tales of those who ventured in but never returned. Armed with only your wits and a flickering flashlight, you step into the decaying halls, unaware of the sinister presence that awaits.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDare to step into the darkness, and discover the echoes of agony that linger within the walls of St. Agnes Mental Institution. Can you survive the night?",
